  ],
  "checklist": [
    "Stats tab: one title strip with the title, manpower, equipment ratio, delete and close; the identity card with the template button, the name field and the experience; the officer card; the equipment card with its caption",
    "Stats tab: every label and value on its tile, nothing cut except the Trickleback label; the Adjusters card behind the label, the hardness bar and the adjusters",
    "History tab: no Adjusters card any more; the summary card (Command History, the two counts, Honors) and the list card with dark rows; the list goes to the bottom of the card",
    "Template tab: the Regimental Support row with its five slots and its label is visible again (the Adjusters card no longer covers it)",
    "shift+z presses Promote (an officer can be promoted; Escape or right click leaves the picker)",
    "A tank division: equipment list with five archetypes, scrolls only beyond that; the adjusters",
    "Both dropdowns open over the window",
    "The window drags by its background, also by the officer and equipment cards",
    "A division row can be clicked in the strip between the list and the window",
    "Template dropdown: card entries of 44 (as in the division list), five before it scrolls"
  ],
